## Tasks Completed

### 1. Deployed FW01

Created a dedicated pfSense virtual machine named `FW01`.

Installed:

- pfSense CE 2.8.1
- ZFS filesystem
- Single virtual-disk ZFS stripe

Configured three virtual network interfaces to support WAN, internal LAN, and attacker-network traffic.

